WEBVTT

00:17:27.814 --> 00:17:30.796
AG: Many leaders fear that hobbies
are a distraction from work,

00:17:30.820 --> 00:17:33.096
but plenty of evidence shows the opposite.

00:17:33.120 --> 00:17:35.056
Leisure activities can energize us

00:17:35.080 --> 00:17:37.776
and increase our confidence
and engagement at work,

00:17:37.800 --> 00:17:40.706
especially if they're
very different from our jobs.

00:17:40.730 --> 00:17:43.686
Felicia practiced with her teammates
twice a week after work,

00:17:43.710 --> 00:17:46.546
and competed in tournaments
as often as she could.

00:17:46.852 --> 00:17:51.116
But that all changed one morning
when she woke up feeling very sick.

00:17:51.140 --> 00:17:52.998
FS: I woke up really shivering.

00:17:53.022 --> 00:17:54.876
And I thought I had the flu,

00:17:54.900 --> 00:17:56.520
but I had a volleyball tournament.

00:17:56.544 --> 00:17:58.926
By about 11 o'clock that same night,

00:17:58.950 --> 00:18:00.536
I wasn't able to breathe well,